<Layout title="Teleprompter Pal vs Prompt+ | iPhone Comparison" description="Compare Teleprompter Pal and Prompt+ for iPhone: recording, free script limits, reversible edits, voice scrolling, mirror rigs and US subscription or one-time pricing." type="article" published="2026-10-23" modified="2026-10-23">
  <SiteHeader />
  <main id="main" class="container compare-main">
    <article itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Article">
      <link itemprop="mainEntityOfPage" href="https://teleprompterpal.com/compare/prompt-plus-alternative/" />
      <meta itemprop="datePublished" content="2026-10-23" />
      <meta itemprop="dateModified" content="2026-10-23" />
      <nav class="compare-breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><a href="/compare/">Compare</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span aria-current="page">Teleprompter Pal vs Prompt+</span></nav>
      <header class="comparison-intro">
        <div class="comparison-apps" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/app-icon.webp" width="76" height="76" alt="" /><span>vs</span><img src="/images/compare/prompt-plus-app-icon.jpg" width="76" height="76" alt="" /></div>
        <h1 itemprop="headline">Teleprompter Pal vs Prompt+</h1>
        <p class="comparison-deck" itemprop="description"><strong>Choose Teleprompter Pal for free recording and reversible saved edits.</strong></p>
        <p class="comparison-intro-note">Every Teleprompter Pal export requires Pro. Prompt+ lists a $19.99 one-time reader upgrade and free scripts up to 750 characters.</p>
        <div class="comparison-action"><a href="#pricing" class="button button-primary" aria-label="View Teleprompter Pal pricing">See pricing <Icon name="arrowRight" size={20} /></a><p>Available for iPhone · Free recording and editing</p></div>
        <p class="comparison-disclosure">By the <span itemprop="author" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Organization"><span itemprop="name">Teleprompter Pal team</span><link itemprop="url" href="https://teleprompterpal.com/about/" /></span>. We build Teleprompter Pal. Sources checked <time datetime="2026-10-23">23 October 2026</time>. <a href="#evidence">See the evidence.</a></p>
      </header>
      <nav class="comparison-jumps" aria-label="On this page"><a href="#features">Features</a><a href="#pricing">Pricing</a><a href="#why-pal">Why choose Teleprompter Pal</a><a href="#competitor-fit">When Prompt+ fits</a><a href="#evidence">Tests &amp; sources</a></nav>
      <section id="features" class="comparison-section" aria-labelledby="features-title">
        <h2 id="features-title">Feature comparison</h2>
        <p class="comparison-section-lead">Teleprompter Pal is our pick for recording and refining a scripted take on one iPhone. Prompt+ documents voice-following, mirror-rig and presentation controls, with a different purchase model.</p>
        <p class="table-help" id="table-help">This is Prompt+ Teleprompter by Norton Five Ltd, app 1483052809, separate from Teleprompter for Video. Scroll sideways on smaller screens; a dash means unverified. <a href="#editions">Product and source details.</a></p>
        <div class="comparison-table-wrap" role="region" aria-labelledby="features-title" aria-describedby="table-help" tabindex="0">
          <table class="comparison-table" aria-label="Teleprompter Pal and Prompt+ feature comparison"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Feature</th><th scope="col">Teleprompter Pal</th><th scope="col">Prompt+</th></tr></thead><tbody>{rows.map(row => <tr><th scope="row">{row.feature}<span class="comparison-feature-note">{row.note}</span></th><td><ComparisonStatus {...row.pal} /></td><td><ComparisonStatus {...row.competitor} /></td></tr>)}</tbody></table>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section id="pricing" class="comparison-section comparison-pricing" aria-labelledby="pricing-title">
        <h2 id="pricing-title">Pricing comparison</h2>
        <p class="comparison-section-lead">Prompt+ lists $19.99 once for its reader upgrade, below Teleprompter Pal’s $59.99 annual export plan. The bundles and billing periods differ.</p>
        <div class="comparison-plan-grid">
          <section class="comparison-plan comparison-plan-primary" aria-labelledby="teleprompter-plan-title">
            <h3 id="teleprompter-plan-title">Teleprompter Pal</h3>
            <div class="comparison-plan-tier"><h4>Free</h4><p class="comparison-price">$0</p><ul><li>Scripts, rehearsal and camera recording</li><li>Playback, trim, crop and saved edits</li><li>Original retained separately from the edit</li></ul><p class="comparison-plan-note">Text safeguard: 1 MB. Every MP4 export and Photos, Files or Share delivery requires Pro.</p></div>
            <div class="comparison-plan-tier"><h4>Pro Yearly</h4><p class="comparison-price">{offer.yearly}<span>/year</span></p><ul><li>MP4 export</li><li>Save to Photos, Files or Share</li><li>{offer.annualTrial}</li></ul><p class="comparison-plan-note">Billed annually. Renews automatically until cancelled.</p></div>
            <div class="comparison-plan-tier"><h4>Other Pro options</h4><dl class="comparison-plan-options"><div><dt>Monthly</dt><dd>{offer.monthly}<span>/month</span></dd></div><div><dt>Weekly</dt><dd>{offer.weekly}<span>/week</span></dd></div></dl><p class="comparison-plan-note">Same Pro export and delivery features. No introductory trial on these plans. Subscriptions renew automatically until cancelled.</p></div>
          </section>
          <section class="comparison-plan" aria-labelledby="competitor-plan-title">
            <h3 id="competitor-plan-title">Prompt+</h3>
            <div class="comparison-plan-tier"><h4>Free reader</h4><p class="comparison-price">$0</p><ul><li>Scripts up to 750 characters</li><li>Manual and voice-scrolling features documented</li><li>Optional skip-login local mode documented</li></ul><p class="comparison-plan-note">The character cap describes script length, not a recording timer. Exact feature gates and the installed free workflow have not been tested. Video recording and delivery are unverified here.</p></div>
            <div class="comparison-plan-tier"><h4>Premium Teleprompter</h4><p class="comparison-price">$19.99<span> once</span></p><ul><li>Listed US in-app purchase amount</li><li>Description places longer scripts behind a one-off upgrade</li><li>No recurring monthly or annual subscription for that purchase</li></ul><p class="comparison-plan-note">The one-off period comes from the description and terms. It is a reader upgrade, not a verified video export bundle. Eligible checkout and exact current inclusions were not inspected.</p></div>
            <div class="comparison-plan-tier"><h4>Check future-service inclusions</h4><p class="comparison-plan-note">The terms say the one-time purchase does not automatically renew, but future versions, premium features, AI, cloud services or add-ons may cost extra. Do not assume every future service is included. No competitor trial is verified here.</p></div>
